# prime prints the vault heading and one block per matching document.
exec specshelf --home $WORK/vault prime --repo billing
cmpenv stdout prime.stdout

# With no match it says so under the same heading.
exec specshelf --home $WORK/vault prime --repo nothing
cmpenv stdout empty.stdout

-- prime.stdout --
# Agent Spec Vault

Vault: `$WORK/vault`

## Relevant Specs And Decisions

- `spec-20261017-alpha` (spec, active) Alpha
  Path: `specs/2026-10-17-alpha.md`
  Repos: billing
  Tags: tooling
  Codex sessions: s1
